      "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a Noetherian scheme. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals. The functor\n<MATH_0003>\nis fully faithful, see Categories, Remark <REF_0001>.\n",
