      "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be objects of\n<MATH_0003>. A morphism of pro-objects\n<MATH_0004> from <MATH_0005> to <MATH_0006> is given\nby a system of maps\n<MATH_0007> compatible with\nthe transition maps where <MATH_0008>, <MATH_0009>\nis an increasing function (in particular <MATH_0010>). Since\n<MATH_0011>\nand since <MATH_0012> is annihilated by <MATH_0013>\nwe see that <MATH_0014> induces a map <MATH_0015>.\n",
